<h2>Asobi 1.0 (build 952)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>The note field resizes</b>: drag the grip above the composer up for a taller field; double-click it to reset. Same gesture as the web page.</li>
<li><b>A web voice note with no speech is a note, not an error.</b> The note reads <i>(no speech detected — play the note)</i> beside its play control instead of raising a dialog; the audio is kept.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
